Third-party model weights (not part of this distribution)
---------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no model weights. At runtime the app downloads
pre-quantized MLC builds of the models below (from mlc-ai on Hugging Face,
https://huggingface.co/mlc-ai, with WebGPU model libraries from
https://github.com/mlc-ai/binary-mlc-llm-libs), mirrored on Korum's
Cloudflare R2 bucket. The weights are NOT licensed under Apache-2.0 by
